OL,3,GNEWSACrash leaves motorway shut in both
OL,4,Adirections
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M4 in Berkshire has
OL,7,Fbeen closed both ways after a crash.
OL,9,FThe motorway is closed between junction
OL,10,F8/9 for Maidenhead and junction 10 for
OL,11,FReading.
OL,13,FNational Highways said a police
OL,14,Finvestigation was under way and the
OL,15,Fmotorway was expected to remain shut
OL,16,F"throughout the morning peak period".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
