OL,3,GNEWSACrash leaves motorway shut in both
OL,4,Adirections
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiversions are in place, with traffic
OL,7,Fheading west diverted off the motorway
OL,8,Fat junction 8/9 and onto the A404M and
OL,9,Fheading east off at junction 10 to the
OL,10,FA329M northbound. Drivers are being
OL,11,Fwarned to allow extra time for their
OL,12,Fjourney.
